/-- ★ THE DOWN/CONFINEMENT BUNDLE'S LOG: `cutLog downConfBundle = cutLog mbRatioDerived + 8·cutPi/3`
    (the up/down fold-phase log lifted by the confinement rung `+8π/3`). -/
